  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ateneo HR Center - Addressing Impunity and Access to Justice Gaps</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Anti-Impunity Clinics: Addressing Impunity and Access to Justice Gaps in Gross Human Rights Violations against Human Rights and Environmental Defenders through Activating Law Clinics and Civil Society Collaborations. The Clinics will engage law students and civil society in developmental legal work such as: engagement w/ key actors, data &amp; evidence gathering, strategic advocacy &amp; legal interventions, &amp; capacity-building &amp; education.</narrative>
  </description>
